This file switches my-Sabaki into portable mode.

While it sits next to my-Sabaki.exe, the app keeps its settings, themes, engine
list and Electron caches in the "data" folder beside it instead of
%APPDATA%\my-Sabaki on the host machine -- so the whole folder can live on a USB
stick and carry its own state.

本文件用于开启 my-Sabaki 的便携模式。

只要它和 my-Sabaki.exe 位于同一目录，程序就会把设置、主题、引擎列表以及 Electron
缓存保存在旁边的 data 文件夹中，而不是宿主机的 %APPDATA%\my-Sabaki；因此整个文件夹
可以放在 U 盘里随身携带。

Delete this file to go back to the normal per-user installation behaviour.
删除本文件即恢复为常规的「按用户存放设置」行为。
